## **4. Knowledge Base Update Flow**

When a new company document is added, Auronix processes it through the following flow:

```text
New Document
     |
     v
File Validation
     |
     v
Document Parsing
     |
     v
Text Extraction
     |
     v
Chunking
     |
     v
Embedding Generation
     |
     v
Chroma Vector Database
     |
     v
Metadata Stored
     |
     v
Document Becomes Searchable
```

When an existing document is updated:

```text
Updated Document
       |
       v
Detect New Version
       |
       v
Remove Old Chunks
       |
       v
Process New Content
       |
       v
Generate New Embeddings
       |
       v
Insert New Vectors
```

This prevents outdated information from remaining in retrieval results.

